<title>Synchronize Data</title>
<context ID_FILE_SYNCHRONIZE />

A data entry application may be able to synchronize data with a <link CSPro::sync_services.csdoc>synchronization service</link>. If so, the <b>Synchronize</b> menu option (off the <b>File</b> menu) will be enabled when you are not currently working in any case. When you select this option, CSEntry will attempt to connect to the synchronization service and then <link CSPro::synchronization.csdoc>synchronize</link> data using parameters specified by the application programmer.

You may have to enter a username and/or password before the synchronization process begins.
